    "story": {
      "type": "ca-story-rows",
      "blocks": {
        "row_1": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>From our Los Angeles roots to serving brands worldwide, Conspire is the boutique Shopify agency that understands your growth ambitions. We're not just pixel pushers – we're strategic partners who've been perfecting eCommerce since the platform's early days.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/conspire-la-hollywood.jpg"
          }
        },
        "row_2": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>From those early days launching multi-million dollar clothing label Doses on Shopify to becoming an established Los Angeles Shopify agency, we've maintained our commitment to boutique-level service while staying at the forefront of platform innovation.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/conspire-la-doses.png"
          }
        },
        "row_3": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We're proud to be official Shopify Plus partners, operating from our Los Angeles and San Diego locations to serve discerning brands who demand both strategic thinking and technical excellence.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/conspire-la-street.png"
          }
        },
        "row_4": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Unlike massive agencies with 100+ employees, our intimate scale allows us to maintain the hands-on approach that LA entrepreneurs value - because we started as entrepreneurs ourselves.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/conspire-la-founders.png"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "row_1",
        "row_2",
        "row_3",
        "row_4"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "",
        "show_numbers": true,
